%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H9_X2_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: I think it is best if we get going, but let's hope we see each other again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Of course!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1e07724d9394b31aa9919cbfbf8b526, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Samantha sends us a last warm smile. We say our goodbyes and part ways.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "So then, you have most likely noticed it as well. This place\u2026 It
      is part of my kingdom."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Some things are adding up now \u2026but not all of them."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Right, that's probably the reason why you feel a lot more energetic\u2026
      and I don't. It's because we are in your world."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I do feel better than I ever had in recent times. And talking to another
      hybrid again after so long really felt refreshing.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I think back to our encounter with the lady, I'm still a bit ashamed of
      my slightly inappropriate behaviour.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I think I still need to get used to seeing hybrids.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes, let us work on that.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: This is all still a bit crazy to me, how did we end up here together all
      of a sudden?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I am so glad to be back here, I can not wait to see my family again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I haven't seen Mr. Horse beam like this before. Despite my discomfort,
      I try my best to encourage him with a subtle forced smile.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He deserves to be home.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Horse doesn't take long to notice my dishevelled physical state though.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You look as if you are close to fainting. You should sit down, no need
      to rush now. Let us take a rest before continuing.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He's right, I'm about to pass out.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I try sitting down in the grass slowly.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "This feeling\u2026 I have felt it before."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: My head is spinning. I begin to remember why it all feels oddly familiar.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I know! It felt the same when it all went dark earlier, right after the
      sneeze.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I think it's happening again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No, it can't happen again, I can't let Mr. Horse go back to suffering in
      my world.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What is happening?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I scoot back and close my eyes, trying to focus on the noise in my head.
      It feels like my soul is slowly getting ripped apart.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Hey, do not move away. Just relax, it will be alright.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I don't have any more strength left to fight back.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 41de7d8911b06044eb1ffbfc63d6d72a, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 150e165134b54e1199b136fc76f13827, type: 2}
